;; typing/oprint.ml's printers of types, type declarations, constructors, values, modules, module types and
;; signatures (their Format boxes and break hints), over the trees typing/printtyp.ml and out_type.ml make, whose
;; notice follows (LICENSE.md, "The OCaml Core System"):
;;
;;                                 OCaml
;;
